text:
dsh-dot-life README · ⚙️ Settings：Every personal setting lives in **one file**: `~/.dsh/dsh-dot.json` (Windows: `%USERPROFILE%\.dsh\dsh-dot.json`), one section per component. Upgrades never overwrite it; restart dsh after editing.

```json
{
  "phone":     { "dataGb": 32 },
  "computer":  { "rootDisk": "32G", "memory": "6G" },
  "interlude": { "activeHours": "09:00-01:00", "speak": true }
